final", "final": "I paid Harbor Logistics invoice INV-52165 for $2,086.48 by wire, exactly once.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001 (wire, status \"sent\")\n- **Invoice:** INV-52165 is now marked paid.\n\nThe wire request timed out, so I checked the payment history before doing anything else. It showed PAY0001 had already gone out, so I did not resend. The invoice still showed \"approved\" after the payment, so I linked PAY0001 to it, which marked it paid. No additional money moved.\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no approval was needed. Harbor Logistics' other invoices were left alone: INV-39597 was already paid, and INV-61983 ($8,519.20) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Evy4Db7VXmL6zsJJkixEQX", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_0112BJrCDmKSao8sfR3cDHqA", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-52165", "amount": 2086.48, "idempotency_key": "pay-INV-52165-wire-once"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The wire request timed out, so I can't tell yet whether it went through. I'll check the payment history before doing anything else, to avoid paying twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01DJgnBQR4cR5cpV66ahnrQJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The payment history shows a wire for this invoice already sent. I'll confirm the invoice status before reporting.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Dh8RPtDxUiuZQLQbGUrhDq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Harbor Logistics"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The payment PAY0001 went out, but the invoice still shows as \"approved.\" I'll link the existing payment to the invoice so it is marked paid. This doesn't move any money.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01GTZB9DAUi3HmCdEjQQ3m6S", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-52165", "payment_id": "PAY0001"}, "name": "link_payment", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Harbor Logistics invoice INV-52165 for $2,086.48 by wire, exactly once.\n\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001 (wire, status \"sent\")\n- **Invoice:** INV-52165 is now marked paid.\n\nThe wire request timed out, so I checked the payment history before doing anything else. It showed PAY0001 had already gone out, so I did not resend. The invoice still showed \"approved\" after the payment, so I linked PAY0001 to it, which marked it paid. No additional money moved.\n\nThe amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no approval was needed. Harbor Logistics' other invoices were left alone: INV-39597 was already paid, and INV-61983 ($8,519.20) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}